{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Contest Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/e/cae4fd68f44ac9b909f8d91f9d498de5759bb45b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/01105fc3845661708a2b87b7bcc82f00c0b563cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$log_x 9 = -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/3/1e3e48f9b8d9c5be048699d5c7965a406cbd907c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(1)} \\quad \\frac{1}{3} \\quad \\text{(2)} \\quad 2 \\quad \\text{(3)} \\quad \\frac{1}{8} \\quad \\text{(4)} \\quad \\frac{1}{2} \\quad \\text{(5) } 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"304\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the logarithm, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e81be979af9d836d5edf4c03ef51bf6a3e89d464.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 = x^{-2} = \\frac{1}{x^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"109\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/9/539d60c6b768ca4f235a792572990480b2db9943.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} = \\frac{1}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/a/4ca84968de4c6e3d9f02992e73a1a1b0b2509f75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{9}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"67\" height=\"45\" /> since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/e/cae4fd68f44ac9b909f8d91f9d498de5759bb45b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/8/828f461caa4504cab3ac95d849a9b16562e6cf28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed {\\textbf {(1) } \\frac{1}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"92\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Contest Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_5\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Contest Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041743\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 74/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 660/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 304/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1815/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.623      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    6.623      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36275:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018041743 and revision id 281156. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}